"""B7 v2 questions: the same 90 sources as questions_spec.py, re-asked the way an engineer or operator
would ask an internal assistant (a situation or need, no KIP number / Jira key / source title in the
question, no ids required as key facts). build_questions.py --spec questions_spec_v2 checks every quote
and key fact against the fetched source and lints the wording (see QUESTIONS.md, "v2").

Same shorthand as questions_spec.py; `from_id` is the v1 question this one replaces.
code_only refers to the code-only arm, which does NOT index docs/ (see QUESTIONS.md).
"""

